  "title": "Overnight French Toast II",
  "description": "Make this the night before and enjoy brunch with your kids rather than catering to them! Also great for taking places because the syrup is built-in.",
  "authors": [
    "BOBSROAD"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-04T23:56:07-05:00",
